  "label": "The manicured nails are mapped as Hitler's vanity symbol",
  "description": "The visual entity 'person_with_manicured_nails' is mapped onto the textual message 'get your nails ready'. The text implies that one should prepare their nails for when they need to 'show them off', and this is projected onto Hitler's image, suggesting that his manicured nails (or appearance) were his vanity symbol. This is an analogical mapping where the visual representation of vanity is linked to the textual instruction.",
